13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# How to Choose the Right Email Marketing Tool: A Decision Framework for 2026"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["> ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," With hundreds of platforms on the market, choosing the right one is overwhelming. This framework covers pricing, features, and scalability -- backed by 2026 market data, real-world benchmarks, and actionable steps to cut through the noise."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The email marketing tool landscape isn't just crowded -- it's *fragmented*. As of Q1 2026, there are ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"427 active email service providers (ESPs)"}]," globally (Source: Martech 5000 Report, 2026), up from 289 in 2023. Meanwhile, 68% of mid-market B2B marketers report switching tools at least once in the past 18 months -- often due to *unmet scalability needs* or *hidden cost creep* (HubSpot State of Marketing Report, 2026)."]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["So how do you avoid the $12,000+ average cost of a misaligned platform rollout (Gartner, 2025)? Not with feature checklists -- but with a *decision framework* rooted in your business stage, growth trajectory, and operational reality."]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Here's your 2026-tested framework -- built around three pillars: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Pricing Integrity"}],", ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Feature Fit"}],", and ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Scalability Readiness"}],"."]}],["$","hr","12",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","14",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"🧾 Pillar 1: Pricing Integrity -- Look Beyond the \"$9/month\" Tagline"}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["In 2026, pricing models have evolved beyond simple contact tiers. Watch for these *critical cost drivers*:"]}],["$","p","18",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Contact definition"}],": Does \"10,000 contacts\" include unsubscribed, bounced, or test emails? (Mailchimp now counts *all* stored profiles; Brevo excludes hard bounces after 90 days.)"]}],["$","p","19",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Engagement-based billing"}],": Platforms like Omnisend and Klaviyo now charge based on *active contacts* (those who opened/clicked in last 90 days) -- saving SMBs up to 37% vs. static lists (McKinsey Email Benchmarks, 2026)."]}],["$","p","20",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"API & automation overages"}],": Sending 50K transactional emails/month via API may trigger +$299/mo fees on ConvertKit -- but costs $0 on SendGrid (now owned by Twilio, with transparent pay-as-you-go)."]}],["$","p","22",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ","$L17",": Run a 30-day audit. Export your list and tag contacts by:"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34"]}]
