Salesforce Email Ops Survey, 2026)"}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"className":"border-b border-[#5F1E1E]/50 hover:bg-[#401616]/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"**Enterprise ($10M+)**"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"IP warm-up automation, dedicated IP options, role-based permissions (RBAC), SOC 2 Type II compliance, multi-language dynamic content blocks"}],["$","td","2",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-[#BE8A83]","children":"Assuming \"white-label\" means full branding control -- 61% of enterprise teams discover template CSS overrides are disabled post-contract (Forrester Wave™, Q1 2026)"}]]}]]}]]}]}]
